{"id":"vod_sn_37373","vodId":"37373","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"龙珠超","name_cn":"龙珠超","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/6320cb21f7aca7b2f8888e3c1edb13b3.jpg"},"summary":"结束了与魔人布欧的惨烈之战后，多灾多难的地球重归和平，而作为救世主存在的孙君（野泽雅子 配音）还生人间，和家人们过着无忧无虑的快乐生活。这边厢Z战士们安享太平，遥远的宇宙最深处，一个可怕的神明悠然苏醒。他是破坏神比鲁斯（山寺宏一 配音），嗜好美食又无比任性，稍有不满意的地方便面不改色地摧毁一颗星球以及上面的生命，堪称是界王神都不敢轻易招惹的可怕神明。受一个神秘之梦的侵扰，比鲁斯决定寻找强大的对手比试一番。他和随从维斯（森田成一 配音）来到了地球。孙悟空和伙伴们面临前所未有的挑战，而他将朝着神的境界全力冲刺……　　本片是由鸟山明担任原案所开启的全新的龙珠故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:51:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":131,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/9Yrz6RrpuB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a6uduBLNT01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UX3ZZ0JvAj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g7e86Kk0rp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hc89uPpC3x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zVfKRKvD8E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GKXuvWgPQn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8MakTdGSs01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/45SZjKzbfS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kETtudqrMt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tYxBEm2Bxm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jpXg3TdVxm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Aq4z1U0L5Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1Gv6TPCbHP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":